1. Purpose
Web-Honeypot is a college educational project developed for learning, academic research, experimentation, and demonstration of web honeypot technologies and related security concepts.
This license is intended to make the project freely available for educational and non-commercial purposes while protecting it against unauthorized commercial exploitation.

